<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Campbell Terry | Personal Website</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f4f6f8;
    color: #222;
}

header {
    background: #111827;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 70px 20px;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
}

header p {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 0;
}

section {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 30px auto;
    padding: 30px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

h2 {
    color: #111827;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    color: #666;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Campbell Terry</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my personal website</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
        Welcome to my website. This is my personal space where you can learn
        more about me, my interests, and the things that matter to me.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>My Interests</h2>
    <p>
        I enjoy connecting with people, learning new things, and making the
        most out of life.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
        Thank you for visiting my website.
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Campbell Terry. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
